headers ({"Auto parry (Portnoy, Fri Oct 29 14:26:29)","reply to last messasge (Papoose, Fri Oct 29 18:18:24)","reply to 2 msgs ago (Dent, Fri Oct 29 18:29:55)","Right (Swampthing, Sat Oct 30 05:07:55)","anarchy (Raedwulf, Sun Oct 31 20:58:08)","re:anarchy (Kirk, Tue Nov  2 12:39:13)","testing (Riperion, Tue Nov  2 19:42:12)","finish (Grimbold, Tue Nov  2 22:05:26)","bah (Portnoy, Wed Nov  3 00:05:44)","huh? (Hudson, Thu Nov  4 06:39:39)","BYE!!! (Wartel, Thu Nov  4 15:41:05)","Any newbies looking to join a group (Nosepick, Sun Nov  7 16:00:14)","back and forth (Papoose, Sun Nov  7 20:47:07)","clones (Hudson, Mon Nov  8 12:55:14)","flashback (Hudson, Mon Nov  8 14:22:05)","safe zones (Dent, Mon Nov  8 15:13:46)","Ack! (Rnorby, Mon Nov  8 19:15:16)","Double Wield (Papoose, Tue Nov  9 04:29:28)","stuff (Gemeni, Tue Nov  9 08:13:01)","double wield (Bandersnatch, Wed Nov 10 09:19:48)","this board (Wind, Wed Nov 10 13:13:58)","brass knuckles (Damrond, Wed Nov 10 15:58:28)","RE: This board (Dent, Thu Nov 11 02:19:16)","skills... [Zaknefein] (Zaknefein, Thu Nov 11 11:48:15)",})
messages ({"You should make an alias for parry.\nthen you can just hit a key and be okay.\n\nIf yer being killed, it's not cause you aren't typing fast enough, it's\ncause you aren't GOOD enough yet to last to type parry.\n\nJust a note from a new guild member...\n\nPortnoy\n","Wronnnng!!!!\n","Wrong!!! Many of us play with pretty serious local lag much of the time... we can be killed in the time it takes an alias to go through.\n\nDENT \n(Not that I particually agree with auto  parry)\n","That would be disasterous for newbies!..\nWarriors dont have a choice to decide wether to parry or not!\nFEH!\nPoor newbies like we wouldn't have enuf fatique to fight! :(\n","heh!\n\ntalk about anarchy ... this muds gone wild!!!!!\n","anarchy: ya gotta love it....\n","does any one know when they are gonna be done?\n","i have heard by wednesday...who knows, but this \"anarchy\" gets really boring really fast...\n","you just got to know how\nto do it right, dude!\n","what are you talking about portnoy?\n","GOODBYE!!!  I'm leaving because warrior's isn't working out for me...I don't know what guild I'l go to but BYE!!!\n","any newbies looking to form a group\n\n\n\nbeam me up\n","hmm the guild board seems to disapear and reappear for no reason can anyone enlighten me?\n","every newbie warrior buy a clone, older warriors will tell you how, and what it does....here is how to avoid stat loss...regenerate...and when you activate it, create without moving one room...and NEVER think that a pkiller will not be happy killing you once...they will kill you as many times as they see you.\n","whenever you go into lounge, go north into daves bar and south again...when a trip flashback's you you will go to daves bar...which is also a no combat zone.\n","Might as well not exist anymore.\nRogues have poison back and can poison us there ase easily as anywhere else.\n\nWATCH OUT\n\n","Okay, We have determined that these damned guilds around us are easily killing warriors that are not yet strong... and of course they also tagteam to get rid of us all... And again... as all of this is going on.... we have lost one of our good skills...\nDouble Wield, of course, so what is taking them so long to work out the problems... and how long will it be before we get some more skills?  This is getting mighty dangerous....\n","Life without double wield sux......\n","\tOk, spiner has not been on recently to fix double wield, I have looked into it\nbut cant seem to find why its not working, also I did make a room where you could avoid poison and such, only prob is I got in trouble for it so its gone now, oh well so much for helping out\n","\tI never had a problem with double wield.....I don't think anything was wrong with it.  Could it be we're just the butt of some sick joke?\n\tJust wondering....\n\n\t\t\t\t\tBeware the Jabberwock.....\n","I'm just posting to say that it is a lot easier to read stuff that is\non the player body board than it is to on this one.  It works the same\nas the player news and fi you type <]p all> it will list all the boards.\nThen type <]s #>, # being the page number of the warrior page.\nThis will subscribe you to the board.  You can do this anywhere not just\nin here so that if you are sitting healing or whatnot and are not in\nthe mood to talk to anyone you can read or post from it.\nType <help news> for more info.\n\nWind -+- just wants to do everthing the easy way.\n","need them, tell me, very reasonable price!~e\n","I agree entirely with you wind ... \n\nDENT\n","Note to all warriors...\nBe wary of training in skills like aid or any skills here....I tried and it gave me an error....\nI lost about 275k xp....Rollerblade the nice wix that he is gave me 100k back but still....\nJUST BE CAREFUL...these days without 2wield we need all the help we can get....Zak\n",})
